{"id":50,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"洛北サイエンスで探究心を伸ばす","feature_description":"京都府立洛北高等学校附属中学校は、洛北サイエンスを特色とし、自然科学への関心と探究する力を育てる中高一貫校です。観察、実験、課題研究などを通して、自ら問いを立てて考える姿勢を大切にします。幅広い学習や学校行事も組み合わせ、論理的に考え、仲間と協働しながら未来を切り拓く力を養います。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":15151,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoto-be.ne.jp/rakuhoku-hs/mt/school_life_j/sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15152,"name":"男子テニス部（硬式）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoto-be.ne.jp/rakuhoku-hs/mt/school_life_j/sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15153,"name":"女子テニス部（硬式）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoto-be.ne.jp/rakuhoku-hs/mt/school_life_j/sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15154,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoto-be.ne.jp/rakuhoku-hs/mt/school_life_j/sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15155,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoto-be.ne.jp/rakuhoku-hs/mt/school_life_j/sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15156,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoto-be.ne.jp/rakuhoku-hs/mt/school_life_j/sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15157,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoto-be.ne.jp/rakuhoku-hs/mt/school_life_j/sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15158,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoto-be.ne.jp/rakuhoku-hs/mt/school_life_j/sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15159,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoto-be.ne.jp/rakuhoku-hs/mt/school_life_j/sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15160,"name":"サイエンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoto-be.ne.jp/rakuhoku-hs/mt/school_life_j/sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15161,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoto-be.ne.jp/rakuhoku-hs/mt/school_life_j/sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15162,"name":"